    "pubDate": "Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:32:32 +0800",
    "html": "<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; color: #1f2329;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 24px 0 14px 0; padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1677ff; background: rgba(22,119,255,0.06); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">🔵 海外深度洞察</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #646a73; margin-left: 10px;\">8 大博客 · 中文精华精翻</span></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #1677ff; background: rgba(22,119,255,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">OpenAI News</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-20 08:00</span><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-medchembench\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #1677ff; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #1677ff; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">阅读原文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">1. AI 能不能帮科学家找候选药</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">MedChemBench 评测 AI 模型解读分子结构、依据实验证据推理并挑选化合物的能力。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #1677ff; background: rgba(22,119,255,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">OpenAI News</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-20 08:00</span><a href=\"https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/hebbia\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #1677ff; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #1677ff; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">阅读原文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">2. 金融研究用上新模型实测</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">Hebbia 用 GPT-6 Astra 做金融研究测试，发现来源覆盖、引用相关性和呈现质量都有提升。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #1677ff; background: rgba(22,119,255,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Latent Space</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-21 05:18</span><a href=\"https://latent.space/p/formal-verification/\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #1677ff; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #1677ff; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">阅读原文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">3. 用数学证明代码正确的新武器</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">过去要靠专家手工完成的软件形式化验证，现在 AI 配合 Lean 正在把这一过程自动化。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 24px 0 14px 0; padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 4px solid #e5484d; background: rgba(229,72,77,0.06); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">🔴 硅谷一线实操（X）</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #646a73; margin-left: 10px;\">产品掌门人实时剧透</span></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #e5484d; background: rgba(229,72,77,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Josh Woodward</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">2026-11-19</span><a href=\"https://x.com/joshwoodward/status/2123534862569324703\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #e5484d; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #e5484d; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看推文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">1. Gemini Mac 版能替你操作电脑了</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">谷歌 Gemini 的 Mac 桌面应用上线新功能：可以直接在你的电脑上执行任务，比如打开软件、点按钮、填表单，不用你一步步手动操作。这是用户呼声最高的需求，适合日常重复性电脑操作多的人先试。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #e5484d; background: rgba(229,72,77,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Amjad Masad</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">2026-11-19</span><a href=\"https://x.com/amasad/status/2123535544718418191\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #e5484d; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #e5484d; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看推文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">2. 一句话让 Replit 帮你搭个私人助理</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">Replit CEO 演示：只写一段提示词，就能搭出类似 Muse 的个人 AI 助理，帮你处理自己的日常事务。不用懂代码，适合想拥有专属小工具、又不想学编程的知识工作者动手试。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #e5484d; background: rgba(229,72,77,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Guillermo Rauch</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">2026-11-19</span><a href=\"https://x.com/rauchg/status/2123468825538789380\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #e5484d; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #e5484d; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看推文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">3. Vercel 新看板：给 AI 代理配个无界面后台</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">Vercel 推出 Board，定位是给 AI 代理用的「无界面 Slack」：没有固定界面，你可以按场景生成最合适的操作台，比如安全团队只看漏洞数和严重等级。意思是界面不再稀缺，重点变成定义清楚你要什么。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 24px 0 14px 0; padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 4px solid #d48806; background: rgba(212,136,6,0.07); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">🟡 国内博主风向（得到大脑）</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #646a73; margin-left: 10px;\">精选视频与干货提炼</span></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #b36a00; background: rgba(212,136,6,0.12); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">林亦LYi</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-19 21:16</span><a href=\"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7709841786620955954/\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #b36a00; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #b36a00; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看视频 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">1. 怒测市面上超火的AI赚钱方法！</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">闲鱼AI服务订单981万单但卖家月均仅897元，实测代做PPT露出AI痕迹且不退款</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #b36a00; background: rgba(212,136,6,0.12); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">清华姜学长</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-19 22:10</span><a href=\"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7709884719118257434/\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #b36a00; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #b36a00; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看视频 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">2. 一分半钟把AI写的项目画成一张地图</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">用一句话让AI把项目代码画成可点击的大白话地图，看懂模块关系</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #b36a00; background: rgba(212,136,6,0.12); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Koji杨远骋</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-19 08:00</span><a href=\"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7709364629218102571/\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #b36a00; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #b36a00; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看视频 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">3. AI 创造的财富 最后会归谁？ ➤ 「十字路口」2026 年终 AI 复盘系列第</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">借科幻小说谈AI财富垄断与失业隐忧，属宏观思辨，无具体落地信息</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #b36a00; background: rgba(212,136,6,0.12); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Koji杨远骋</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">11-18 12:28</span><a href=\"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7709363771256442146/\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #b36a00; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #b36a00; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看视频 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">4. 用 Kimi   给 Kimi 提速 ➤ 「十字路口」2026 年终 AI 复盘</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">Kimi模型自写推理引擎给自己提速，纯前沿技术实践，非技术人难用上</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 24px 0 14px 0; padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 4px solid #0b8235; background: rgba(11,130,53,0.06); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">🟢 股·债·金·汇盘面与专家视点</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #646a73; margin-left: 10px;\">四大资产风向 · 宏观拆解</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 10px 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: #646a73; margin-bottom: 3px;\">上证</div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">3533.79</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0b8235; background: rgba(11,130,53,0.08); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">-1.22%</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 10px 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: #646a73; margin-bottom: 3px;\">沪深300</div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: