le=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">$3539.0</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0b8235; background: rgba(11,130,53,0.08); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">-3.98%</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 10px 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: #646a73; margin-bottom: 3px;\">人民币</div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329;\">6.6736</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0b8235; background: rgba(11,130,53,0.08); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">-0.25%</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #0b8235; background: rgba(11,130,53,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">CNBC Economy</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">2026-11-20</span><a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/16/kevin-warsh-fed-ai-jobs-productivity-interest-rateshtml.html\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #0b8235; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #0b8235; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看原文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">1. 美联储主席押注AI革命，利率怎么走</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">专家指出，美联储主席认为AI正走到关键转折点，但还没想清楚它对就业和利率意味着什么。逻辑是：AI若大幅提升效率，可能压低通胀、给降息空间；若先冲击就业，政策会更纠结。对国内投资者来说，美元利率路径不明，资金流向会更反复，大类资产波动加大，别急着单边押注。</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #0b8235; background: rgba(11,130,53,0.1); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Project Syndicate</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8f959e; margin-left: 8px;\">2026-11-19</span><a href=\"https://www.project-syndicate.org/commentary/china-export-control-regime-threatens-to-upend-global-trade-by-brahma-chellaney-2026-11?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=main&amp;utm_content=en\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #0b8235; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid #0b8235; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto;\">看原文 ↗</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2329; margin-bottom: 6px;\">2. 中国打贸易反制牌，全球资金要重排</div><div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #4e5969; line-height: 1.6;\">专家认为，中国正像美国一样，把关键矿产、工业原料和专用设备的优势当筹码，用来施压和反制别国。逻辑是贸易摩擦从关税升级到供应链卡脖子，全球企业被迫选边、重建库存。对中国市场而言，短期相关资源股和替代链有炒作，但外资会更看重供应链安全，资金流向偏谨慎，波动难免。</div></div>\n</div>"
